Ghame hussain Manana Bohat Zaroori Hai<br>
hussaini Shamma Jalana Bohat Zaroori Hai<br>
<br>
1. Yeh Woh Hussain Hai Jo Fakhr-e1bn-e-aadam Hai<br>
<br>
ke Jis Ke Zer-e-qadam Rif'at-e-do'aalam Hai<br>
<br>
usi Hussain Ke Gham Me Yeh Shor-e-matam Hai<br>
<br>
yeh Baat Sab Ko Batana Bohat Zaroori Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Woh Jis Me Asghar-e-masoom Ka Tabassum Hai<br>
<br>
woh Jis Me Aag Ka Sailaab Hai Talaatum Hai<br>
<br>
woh Jis Me Aakhri Shabbir Ki Sad Gum Hai<br>
<br>
woh Baat Sab Ko Sunana Bohat Zaroori Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Woh Jisne Deen Bachaya Hai Karbala Aakar<br>
<br>
woh Jisne Aakhri Sajda Kiya Tah-e-khanjar<br>
<br>
woh Jiske Dar Pe Farishte Jhuka Rahe Hain Sar<br>
<br>
sar Unke Dar Pe Jhukana Bohat Zaroori Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Woh Bhoook-o-pyaas Woh Barchi Woh Seena-e-akbar<br>
<br>
woh Mashk Aur Woh Baazu Kate Jo Dariya Par<br>
<br>
woh Sheh Ka Aaqri Sajda Who Shimr Ka Khanjar<br>
<br>
har Ek K Yaad Dilana Boht Zaroori Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Khamoosh Aal-e-muhammad Ka Aaj Dera Hai<br>
<br>
bala Ka Shaam-e-ghareeba'n Me Ek Andhera Hai<br>
<br>
rasool Zaadiya'n Aur Khaak Par Basera Hai<br>
<br>
aza Ka Farsh Bichana Bohat Zaroori Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Hussain Hi Toh Sahara Hai Aadmi Ke Liye<br>
<br>
hussain Hi Ki Zaroorath Hai Zindagi Ke Liye<br>
<br>
urooj Azm-e-hussaini Ki Bartari Ke Liye<br>
<br>
nashan-e-raah Batana Bohat Zaroori Hai